  "content": "\n\n<h5><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPUfzJu.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 100+ 任务</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 彻底重做的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic，</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/promenade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Promenade</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 全面优化并完美支持光影</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 自定义<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.horizon.pics%252f39d7ccdc-f694-466a-832b-027a84051a8f%253fa%253d580%2526mime1%253dimage%2526mime2%253dpng\" rel=\"nofollow\">光影预设</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 彻底重做的要塞与堡垒</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 新增首领与生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction，</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frostiful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frostiful）</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 数百个全新地下城与建筑（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorabuild-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdoraBuild: Structures）</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 提升体验的实用功能（QoL），例如&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">传送石</a>与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">经验储存</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero小地图</a>&nbsp;附带额外功能</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 众多自定义特性以优化游戏体验</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 内置&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免费世界分享</a>功能</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f64017%252fbetter-mc-fabric-bmc2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">280+ 个模组</a></strong></h5>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:399px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yEDj3QS45X4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"399\" height=\"249\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:417px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/h2CLjWebHQg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"417\" height=\"248\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>本作品并非Minecraft官方产品。未经Mojang或微软授权或认可。</strong></span></h5>",
